*.o
TABLE.png
# art/ is NOT ignored any more.  It is the one generated thing that
# cannot be generated again: gen-art.py queues every face with seed -1
# and logs/jobs.tsv records only the job id, so re-running the same
# prompts yields 1455 different pictures.  The backs ARE reproducible
# -- BACKS.tsv keeps model, seed and prompt for each.
#
# The faces composed from it and the small ones made from those stay
# out: tools/mkassets.sh remakes both from art/ in a couple of minutes.
card-*.png
client/.godot/
client/assets/backs/
client/assets/cards.tsv
client/assets/cards/
client/assets/thumbs/
client/assets/ui/
court
logs/
sheet*.png
__pycache__/
client/backgrounds/
